/.DS_Store
/.vscode/
CLAUDE.local.md
/.claude/settings.local.json

# Go
/workroom
*.exe

# GoReleaser
/dist/

# macOS app (macapp/)
/macapp/build/
/macapp/DerivedData/
/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/*
# ...except the SPM lockfile. `exactVersion` in project.yml pins a git TAG, which is mutable — the
# libghostty packager has already re-cut one (arm64e shipped 2026-07-21, reverted three days later),
# and Sparkle/Sentry/Defaults are `from:` ranges that float on their own. Package.resolved is the
# only tracked record of what was actually resolved, so a changed dependency is a diff instead of a
# silent swap between your machine, CI (whose SPM cache keys on project.yml) and the release runner.
#
# The chain below is load-bearing: git does NOT descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so a lone
# `!.../Package.resolved` under `/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/` would silently match nothing. Each
# intermediate directory has to be re-included in turn — hence `dir/*` above rather than `dir/`, and
# one negation per level. Verify with:
#   git status --porcelain -uall | grep xcodeproj
# which must list Package.resolved and NOTHING else from this directory. (`git check-ignore -v` is
# the wrong check here: it prints the matching `!` rule and still exits 0, which reads like the file
# is ignored when it isn't.) xcodegen preserves the file across regeneration; it doesn't rewrite it.
!/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/*
!/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/
/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/*
!/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/
/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/*
!/macapp/WorkroomApp.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved
# VCS-core Rust artifacts (built by vcs/scripts/build-apple.sh; regenerated, not tracked).
# Package.swift is tracked; the xcframework + generated Swift inside it are not.
/vcs/swift/WrVcs/Frameworks/
/vcs/swift/WrVcs/.build/
/vcs/swift/WrVcs/Sources/WrVcs/wr_vcs_uniffi.swift
/vcs/swift/WrVcs/Sources/wr_vcs_uniffiFFI/include/
*.xcuserstate
.xcode.env.local

# Python (run-supervisor integration test)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.gstack/
.gbrain-source
